{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25919","headline":"萧史图歌 · 鲍溶","name":"萧史图歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霜绡数幅八月天，彩龙引凤堂堂然。\n小载萧僊穆公女，随仙上归玉京去。\n仙路迢遥烟几重，女衣清净云三素。\n胡髯毵珊云髻光，翠蕤皎洁琼华凉。\n露痕烟迹渍红貌，疑别秦宫初断肠。\n此天每在西北上，紫霄洞客晓烟望。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25919.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25919","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}